{title: Maruvaarthai}
{artist: Enai Noki Paayum Thota Sid Sriram}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Maru Vaarthai Paesaathe,        [D#]Madi Meethu Nee Thoongidu
[D#]Imai Pola Naan Kaakka,        [C#]Kanavaai [D#]Nee Maaridu
[C#]Mayil Thogai [G#]Pole Viral,        [D#]Unnai Varudum
[C#]Manam Paadamaai [G#]Uraiyaadal,        [D#]Nigazhum
[D#]Vizhi Neerum Veenaaga,        [D#]Imai Thaanda Koodaathena
[C#]Thuliyaaha [G#]Naan Serthen,        [C#]Kadalaaha [G#]Kann Aanathe
[D#]Maranthaalum Naan Unnai,        [D#]Ninaikkaatha Naal Illaiye
[C#]Pirinthaalum [G#]En Anbu,        [C#]Oru Pothum [G#]Poi Illaiye
[A#m]Vidiyaatha [D#]Kaalaigal,        [A#m]Mudiyaatha [D#]Maalaigalil
[A#m]Vadiyaatha [G#]Vervai [D#]Thuligal,        [A#m]Piriyaatha [G#]Porvai [D#]Nodigal
[C#]Manikaattum Kadigaaram,        [D#]Tharum Vaathai Arindhom
[C#]Udaimaattrum Idaivaelai,        [D#]Athan Pinbe Unarndhom
[C#]Maravaadhe [G#]Manam,        [C#]Madinthaalum [G#]Varum
[C#]Muthal Nee [D#]Mudivum Nee,        [C#]Alar Nee [D#]Agilam Nee
[A#m]Tholaidhooram [D#]Sendraalum,        [A#m]Thoduvaanam [D#]Endraalum Nee
[A#m]Vizhiyoram [G#]Thane [D#]Marainthai,        [A#m]Uyirodu [G#]Munbe [D#]Kalanthaai
[C#]Ithazh Ennum Malar Kondu,        [D#]Kadithangal Varainthaai
[C#]Bathil Naanum Tharum Munbe,        [D#]Kanavaagi Kalainthaai
[C#]Pidivaatham [G#]Pidi,        [C#]inam Theerum [G#]Adi
[C#]Izhandhm [D#]Ezhil Kølam,        [C#]Inimel [D#]Mazhai Kaalam
